<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Movie Gallery lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Movie Gallery lowered.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Raymond James said it lowered its recommendation on Movie Gallery Inc to neutral from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Shares were off 5/8 to 5-3/4 in morning Nasdaq trade.</p>
</text>
